narrow is call
narrow in main
narrow invokes convert.int64ToInt32
narrow arg value Int64 small copy
narrow out narrowed Int32
narrow ownedBy none
narrow cleanedBy none
narrow borrows none
narrow catch none

widenNarrowed is call
widenNarrowed in main
widenNarrowed invokes convert.int32ToInt64
widenNarrowed arg value Int32 narrowed copy
widenNarrowed out back Int64
widenNarrowed ownedBy none
widenNarrowed cleanedBy none
widenNarrowed borrows none
widenNarrowed catch none

showNarrowed is call
showNarrowed in main
showNarrowed invokes showInt
showNarrowed arg value Int64 back copy
showNarrowed out none
